# apps/api/Dockerfile only needs apps/api/pyproject.toml and apps/api/app/ --
# everything else in this monorepo is dead weight in the build context (was
# 3.6 GB / 131k files before this file existed: apps/web's node_modules alone
# is 613 MB). Exclude by default, then allow back in only what the Dockerfile
# actually COPYs.
*

# Docker requires every intermediate directory level to be explicitly
# un-ignored too -- re-including a nested path alone does not implicitly
# un-ignore its parents.
!apps
!apps/api
!apps/api/pyproject.toml
!apps/api/app
!apps/api/app/**
